[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14041.269, "timestamp": "03:54:01", "text": "追捕我们。别那样做。还没有。不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14043.67, "timestamp": "03:54:03", "text": "然而。呃，维克，你有鸡蛋吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14048.389, "timestamp": "03:54:08", "text": "你？不，我像模特一样。是的，我发现了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14051.189, "timestamp": "03:54:11", "text": "地上还有另一个鸡蛋。好的，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14053.67, "timestamp": "03:54:13", "text": "我可以吗？好吧，你知道吗？美好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14058.229, "timestamp": "03:54:18", "text": "忘了这里吧。好的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14065.67, "timestamp": "03:54:25", "text": "需要多少紫外线才能杀死一个Z"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14068.469, "timestamp": "03:54:28", "text": "恶魔蜘蛛之类的东西？哇。我不知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14075.99, "timestamp": "03:54:35", "text": "嗯。这不像是，不像是50"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14079.429, "timestamp": "03:54:39", "text": "60. 等等，我有一个 I 不。呃，有一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14081.75, "timestamp": "03:54:41", "text": "屏幕上有指示。就像我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14086.469, "timestamp": "03:54:46", "text": "差不多了之类的。哦，我哦，躲起来了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14089.229, "timestamp": "03:54:49", "text": "这是一个藏身之处。好的。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14091.67, "timestamp": "03:54:51", "text": "是的。这个游戏里有什么？但你不能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14093.429, "timestamp": "03:54:53", "text": "躲在里面太久，否则她"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14098.71, "timestamp": "03:54:58", "text": "会找到你的。她会杀了你。是的。"}]